  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Trademark East Africa Rwanda f&#xf6;nstret</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trademark East Africa Rwanda window</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet syftar till f&#xf6;rdjupad regional integration och             konkurransuts&#xe4;ttning i &#xd6;stafrika och inkluderar insatser b&#xe5;de p&#xe5;      regional och nationell niv&#xe5;. TMEAs Rwanda-program &#xe4;r fem&#xe5;rigt och     &#xe4;mnar att st&#xf6;dja implementeringen av Rwandas EAC strategi f&#xf6;r handel  och integration. Programmet inneb&#xe4;r kapacitetsutveckling hos, i       huvudsak, ministerier.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose is greater regional integration and improved trade        competitiveness in East Africa, and it includes activities on a       regional as well as a national level. The TMEA Rwanda country         programme is a five year programme of support for Rwanda&apos;s EAC        regional trade and integration strategy. The programme will provide   capacity building support mainly to government ministries.</narrative>
  </description>
